?u=6239908)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-cat-food" >Dr Cat-food</a></span></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">饺子娘觉得很赞！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭文件</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/zhongfenshouhezuo/%E5%A8%98%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%AD%E5%8F%91%E9%A5%BA%E7%A0%B8"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/zhongfenshouhezuo/%E5%A8%98%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%AD%E5%8F%91%E9%A5%BA%E7%A0%B8/medium.jpg" alt="%E5%A8%98%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%AD%E5%8F%91%E9%A5%BA%E7%A0%B8" class="image" /></a></div> <p>欸~可以哇~你写的文真棒——饺子娘（欣赏地伸出了大拇指）by<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aerawsera" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6242174&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607542481" alt="AeraWserA" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6242174)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aerawsera" >AeraWserA</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Hormress的像素中分兽logo</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭文件</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://ah-sandbox.wikidot.com/local--files/jiaozi/hrjlogo.png" alt="hrjlogo.png" class="image" /><br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">这一条用了一个非常奇怪的格式</span> <p>我想画个像素中分兽结果发现上面已经有了不过我还是画了。</p> <p>企图像素化SCP的尝试（作者<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-hormress" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4142571&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607542481" alt="Dr Hormress" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4142571)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-hormress" >Dr Hormress</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">中分(兽)球！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;新人渣作</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/zhongfenshouhezuo/%E4%B8%AD%E5%88%86%E7%90%832"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/zhongfenshouhezuo/%E4%B8%AD%E5%88%86%E7%90%832/medium.jpg" alt="中分球2" class="image" /></a><br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">画糊了</span><br /> wwwww，这也是第一次画波兰球呢 by<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6150792&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607542481" alt="HigashikataJosuke" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6150792)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" >HigashikataJosuke</a></span></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">饺酱的jiaojiao</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">啊w</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/sucai/%E9%A5%BA%E5%AD%90.png" alt="%E9%A5%BA%E5%AD%90.png" class="image" /><br /> 饺酱貌似没出现过jiaojiao by<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607542481" alt="Frozen starry sky" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" >Frozen starry sky</a></span></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">饺酱转身，背面</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">终于看到后面了</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/sucai/%E9%A5%BA%E9%85%B1%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2.png" alt="%E9%A5%BA%E9%85%B1%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2.png" class="image" /><br /> 大草 by<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607542481" alt="Frozen starry sky" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" >Frozen starry sky</a></span></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">混入的水冰月</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">混入的水冰饺</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/fragment:ylumwlne-1/forzy2.png" alt="forzy2.png" class="image" /><br /> <strong><span class="printuser avatarhov